<title>ESTONIA: BOURSE POSTPONES INKO BALTI MEMBERSHIP.</title>
<headline>BOURSE POSTPONES INKO BALTI MEMBERSHIP.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tallinn stock exchange board on Monday postponed Inko Balti Pank's application to become a bourse member, Helo Meigas, the managing director of the bourse, told Reuters.</p>
<p>&quot;As of the last audit results, its equity does not meet the requirements of the Estonian central bank,&quot; she added.</p>
<p>The Estonian central bank said that it will make its comments on the issue later today.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn Newsroom, +372 630 8400, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
